    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Itius</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Iccius</span></b> ) Portus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a port of the Morini</i>, <i>in Belgic Gaul</i>, <i>from which Cæsar
